      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TALK TO LEXY (4) looks close to a win after placing in both outings off a spell. Produced a very good effort from the back row last time at Young, finishing second and just a head from the winner. Close to peaking and can break through returning to the front line. ISOSCELES KRAMER (2) is a three-year-old colt by Hes Watching having his first start. Showed ability when he won a recent trial at Leeton and is aided by a low draw so look for a good debut. SWIFT RECIPROCITY (7) is a three-year-old filly by Stay Hungry on debut. May need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position has been trialling well including a couple of wins in hitouts here. RISE AGAIN (6) had trialled since a fourth last time out and came from this barrier for a 1.3 second at this circuit and distance prior. IDEAL LILLY (9) should be approaching her peak and draws for a trail.",
